Subject: [PATCH 3/7] lax/pcp-undecidability, lax/mealy-machines: proofs build
 at v4.33.0

S0: Part.mem_bind_iff and Nat.rfind_dom applied term-level (simp/rw now
refuse PFun applications at implicit transparency), one Part.bind_some.
S1: Common/Aux renamed Common/Auxiliary (AUX is a forbidden module-name
component since Lean 4.33), Function.id_def in one simpa, explicit
arguments where Derivs f (a def-wrapped subtype) blocks keyed matching.
No statement changed; concepts untouched.
